# OmniCinema

This project has the omnicinema skill at `skills/omnicinema/SKILL.md` in
this repo (or wherever you copied the `skills/omnicinema/` folder). Read
that file in full before using it.

Quick reference:
- First use: `bash skills/omnicinema/scripts/bootstrap.sh` (clones/builds
  the real omnicinema-mcp server into a local cache — one-time, safe to
  re-run).
- Full tool catalog with exact JSON argument shapes:
  `skills/omnicinema/references/tools.md`.
- Call a tool: `bash skills/omnicinema/scripts/call.sh <tool_name> '<json-args>'`.
- Anything with `generative:true`, or `install_dependencies` with
  `consent:true`, or `approve_suggestion` with `approve:true` costs money
  or runs real installs/APIs — confirm with the user before passing that
  flag, the tool itself can't ask.
- Known upstream build issue documented in the skill's SKILL.md /
  bootstrap.sh — not something to work around by guessing at the missing
  source files.
